  "expirationDate": "2035-08-26",
  "historyNote": "(See Revision Note #1 at Chapter Heading He-W 600) #6446, eff 2-1-97; amd by #7192, eff 2-1-00, amd by #8175, eff 10-1-04; amd by #8269, eff 2-1-05; intro. and paragraphs (d) & (g)-(i) amd by #8740, INTERIM, eff 10-13-06, EXPIRED: 4-11-07; intro. and paragraphs (d) & (g)-(i) amd by #8869, eff 4-19-07; ss by #9104, eff 3-15-08; ss by #11063, eff 3-25-16; ss by #14354, eff 8-26-25, EXPIRES: 8-26-35",
